//github.com/fangzhou-xie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T14:28:20Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T14:28:20Z","body":"@Abdoulaye-SAKHO thanks for your submission! And thanks to the reviewers @jungtaekkim @jncraton!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4371862999/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4371865158","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112#issuecomment-4371865158","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112","id":4371865158,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABBJVeRg","user":{"login":"fangzhou-xie","id":45321577,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1MzIxNTc3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45321577?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie","html_url":"https://github.com/fangzhou-xie","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fangzhou-xie/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-04T14:28:38Z","updated_at":"2026-05-04T17:48:07Z","body":"# Post-Review Checklist for Editor and Authors\n\n## Additional Author Tasks After Review is Complete\n- Double check authors and affiliations (including ORCIDs)\n- Make a release of the software with the latest changes from the review and post the version number here. This is the version that will be used in the JOSS paper.  \n- Archive the release on Zenodo/figshare/etc and post the DOI here.\n- Make sure that the title and author list (including ORCIDs) in the archive match those in the JOSS paper.\n- Make sure that the license listed for the archive is the same as the software license.\n\n## Editor Tasks Prior to Acceptance\n- [x] Double check rendering of paper with ``@editorialbot generate pdf``\n- [x] Specifically check the references with ``@editorialbot check references`` and ask author(s) to update as needed\n- [x] Read the text of the paper and offer comments/corrections (as either a list or a pull request)\n- [x] Check that the title, author list, version tag, and the license are correct in the archived release\n- [x] Set archive DOI with ``@editorialbot set <DOI here> as archive``\n- [x] Set version with ``@editorialbot set <version here> as version``\n- [x] Recommend acceptance with ``@editorialbot recommend-accept``\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/c