min":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T18:04:39Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T18:04:39Z","body":"🚨🚨🚨 **THIS IS NOT A DRILL, YOU HAVE JUST ACCEPTED A PAPER INTO JOSS!** 🚨🚨🚨\n\nHere's what you must now do:\n\n0. Check final PDF and Crossref metadata that was deposited :point_right: https://github.com/openjournals/joss-papers/pull/8105\n1. Wait five minutes, then verify that the paper DOI resolves [https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.10112](https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.10112)\n2. If everything looks good, then close this review issue.\n3. Party like you just published a paper! 🎉🌈🦄💃👻🤘\n\nAny issues? Notify your editorial technical team...","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4381780260/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4382004931","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112#issuecomment-4382004931","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112","id":4382004931,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABBTAWww","user":{"login":"Abdoulaye-SAKHO","id":130471399,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8bV5w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130471399?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO","html_url":"https://github.com/Abdoulaye-SAKHO","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Abdoulaye-SAKHO/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T18:38:06Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T18:38:06Z","body":"We have added the CITATION.cff file and created a joss branch that we will keep.\n\n@jncraton @jungtaekkim @fangzhou-xie @crvernon Thank you so much for taking the time to review the paper and the package as well as for your valuable feedbacks !\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4382004931/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4382332340","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112#issuecomment-4382332340","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112","id":4382332340,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABBTUVtA","user":{"login":"crvernon","id":3947069,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5NDcwNjk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3947069?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon","html_url":"https://github.com/crvernon","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/crvernon/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T19:26:53Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T19:26:53Z","body":"🥳 Congratulations on your new publication @Abdoulaye-SAKHO ! Many thanks to @fangzhou-xie for editing and @jncraton and @jungtaekkim for your time, hard work, and expertise!! JOSS wouldn't be able to function nor succeed without your efforts.\n\nPlease consider becoming a reviewer for JOSS if you are not already:  https://reviewers.joss.theoj.org/join \n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4382332340/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4382332571","html_url":"https://github.com/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112#issuecomment-4382332571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/10112","id":4382332571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAx6EUs8AAAABBTUWmw","user":{"login":"editorialbot","id":89919391,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg5OTE5Mzkx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/89919391?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot","html_url":"https://github.com/editorialbot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/editorialbot/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-05T19:26:55Z","updated_at":"2026-05-05T19:26:55Z","body":":tada::tada::tada: Congratulations on your paper acceptance! :tada::tada::tada:\n\nIf you would like to include a link to your paper from your README use the following\n\n<details><summary><strong>code snippets</strong></summary>\n<p>\n\n```\nMarkdown:\n[![DOI](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/10.21105/joss.010112/status.svg)](https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.010112)\n\nHTML:\n<a style=\"border-width:0\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.010112\">\n  <img src=\"https://joss.theoj.org/papers/10.21105/joss.010112/status.svg\" alt=\"DOI badge\" >\n</a>\n\nreStructuredText:\n.. image:: https://joss.theoj.org/papers/10.21105/joss.010112/status.svg\n   :target: https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.010112\n```\n\n</p>\n</details>\n\nThis is how it will look in your documentation:\n\n[![DOI](https://joss.theoj.org/papers/10.21105/joss.010112/status.svg)](https://doi.org/10.21105/joss.010112)\n\n**We need your help!**\n\nThe Journal of Open Source Software is a community-run journal and relies upon volunteer effort. If you'd like to support us please consider doing either one (or both) of the the following:\n\n- Volunteering to review for us sometime in the future. You can add your name to the reviewer list here: https://reviewers.joss.theoj.org/join\n- Making a small donation to support our running costs here: https://numfocus.org/donate-to-open-journals\n","author_association":"COLLABORATOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openjournals/joss-reviews/issues/comments/4382332571/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]